<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak forex reserves drop to $2.958 bln latest wk.</title>
<headline>Slovak forex reserves drop to $2.958 bln latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Friday its hard currency reserves totalled $2.958 billion as of July 23, down from $2.999 billion on July 17.</p>
<p>  SLOVAK FOREX RESERVES   July 23   July 17  July 9   Dec 31/96</p>
<p>   NBS reserves ($bln)     2.958     2.999    3.021    3.473</p>
<p>   Commercial banks	  3.617     3.671    2.622    2.321</p>
<p>   Entire banking sector   6.575     6.671    5.643    5.794</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
</text>
